+    # patch) rather than as a new full-vocab Triton reduction. None when
+    # draft_probs is unavailable (NO_DRAFT_PROBS): there is no q to compare
+    # against p, so the kernel keeps its original always-strict behaviour.
+    # jsd_defer_mask: r-fuzzy's OWN decision, unmodified -- kept separate
+    # from the merged mask actually handed to the kernel so the tracer can
+    # report a real counterfactual ("what would plain r-fuzzy have done
+    # here") instead of a tautology. Feeding the MERGED mask to the tracer
+    # (an earlier version of this patch did exactly that) makes
+    # lossy_would_accept == strict_would_accept at every guarded position BY
